            "review_text": "Lina\n2 contributions\n1\nBad Service Combined With Cigarette Smell Place\nOct 2024 • Friends\nI came to Oc Oanh by a recommendation from a local here in HCM.. The guy who took my order was unpleasant and the service was bad. I ordered five dishes and they forgot my seafood noodle dish. Had to waved down 4 other servers and waited 30 - 40 minutes just for that. All of the dishes were on the salty side. This place was packed filled with people and they smoke everywhere. The prices are definitely on the higher side. Overall, I wouldn’t be coming back and do not recommend this place. It’s quite dirty to say the least.\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nAvoid this place\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten October 4, 2024",
