            "review_title": "Review at Oc Oanh",
            "review_text": "philip c\n6 contributions\n0\nSimply the best..............\nSep 2023 • Friends\nThis was our first night out in HCMC and it was the best. So busy but were lucky to share a table with an expat couple from California. The seafood was the freshest, the serves were large and although it was jam packed full the service was quick. We had giant prawns, snails, grilled occy and mussels served with bowls of 5 different sauces- all excellent. Cold beers and the good company of the expats made it a top night.\nWe had heard that it costs a bit more here but if it's real good value for money you want, you'll get it here.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten November 1, 2023",
